# CCI manual TC — Sub-task + XLSX

## Input

- **Required:** `CCIPH-###` User Story key
- **Optional:** `smoke` | `regression` | `full`, `draft only`

## Skill

Follow [`.cursor/cci-skills/cci-manual-tc-subtask-xlsx/SKILL.md`](../cci-skills/cci-manual-tc-subtask-xlsx/SKILL.md).

## QA analysis

When designing cases, also follow [cci-testcase.mdc](cci-testcase.mdc) for breadth (positive, negative, edge, regression impact).

## Outputs

1. Jira **Sub-task** per test case (`parent` = story)
2. **Test Case.xlsx** (and CSV) under `qa/manual-test-cases/exports/xlsx/` using template  
   `.cursor/cci-skills/Sample File Reference/Test Case.xlsx`

## Test Case Type column

Use exactly one of:

- Functional Testing
- Integration Testing
- Regression Testing
- Performance Testing
- Security Testing
- Accessibility Testing
- Usability Testing

Do not wait for Yes/Proceed unless the user said **draft only**.
